WEBVTT

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.110
I am the Storm Dragon, Veldora Tempest!

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.280
I am fully revived!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.240
All who defy me will be slaughtered!

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:25.460
Uh, old dude... how do you know that line?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.570
Well, I was bored, 
so I analyzed your memories

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.110
and read all of that "manga" 
stuff you had in there!

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:34.220
Not only that...

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.810
but I play shogi at the 
master level now, too!

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:41.560
No, since I'm the Storm Dragon, 
I've reached the Ryuo level!

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:42.930
<b>Ryuo</b>

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:47.840
I see. Well, I'm glad you enjoyed 
life in my stomach so much.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.440
I'm back after all this time, 
and you're being so cold.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.950
That went a lot more quickly 
than I expected, though!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.580
I thank you, Rimuru Tempest!

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.370
My BFF!

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:07.830
Did you really just say "BFF"? That's so old.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.510
Oh, I almost forgot. Did you not get my gift?

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.910
I'm glad you asked!

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:23.040
Thanks to you, my unique skill, Inquirer,

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.300
evolved into the ultimate skill, Faust!

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.270
It is the power to reach the ultimate truth,

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:31.170
<i>Ah, that makes sense.</i>

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:31.640
born from my insatiable curiosity!

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:35.400
<i>My Great Sage evolved into Raphael, too.</i>

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.640
In other words...

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:36.490
<i>Yes.</i>

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:36.400
<b>Yes</b>

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:37.860
<i>That is not all.</i>

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.160
<i>Analyzing the remains of Veldora</i>

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.290
<i>has given you the ultimate skill "Veldora."</i>

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:47.880
<i>In addition, using the unique skill 
"Unlimited Imprisonment" as a basis</i>

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.460
<b>Unlimited Imprisonment</b>

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:49.990
<i>to consolidate all of your abilities,</i>

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.040
<b>Sticky Steel Thread</b>

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.540
<b>Ability</b>

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.420
<b>Body Double</b>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.540
<b>Consolidation</b>

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:49.830
<b>Area Barrier</b>

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.250
<b>Black Flame</b>

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.500
<b>Black Thunder</b>

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:50.540
<b>Multilayer Barrier</b>

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:53.580
<i>you have successfully acquired 
the ultimate skill "Uriel."</i>

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:50.500
<b>Ultraspeed Regeneration</b>

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.130
Wait, that means I have 
four ultimate skills now!

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>It does mean that.</i>

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:58.470
<b>It does mean that.</b>

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:04.240
And <i>that</i> means you and I are invincible now!

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:06.300
Just relax and go with it!

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.840
R-Right...

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.540
<b>That Time I Got 
Reincarnated as a Slime</b>

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:48.740
Episode 37: The Visitors

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.360
My first time seeing the 
outside world in centuries...

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:56.290
The air tastes so sweet!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:59.620
Look, do you think you can 
tone down that enormous aura?

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.890
You're gonna scare everyone in town.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.430
Very well. I shall try.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.430
Think of it as storing it inside.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.760
Yes, I get it! You mean like that!

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:09.010
Like "that"?

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.600
<i>No, that's just putting out even more aura!</i>

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.530
How's this?!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.500
Hey, not bad!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.530
Your aura's a lot smaller now.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.540
Thank the wisdom of the sacred texts 
that contain all knowledge of the world!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.600
<i>He just tried something he 
read in a manga, didn't he?</i>

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:49.680
Hey, everyone. Sorry I'm late.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.130
Great Rimuru! You're all right!

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:53.640
We were so worried!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:57.960
We suddenly sensed signs of the return 
of the Storm Dragon, Veldora...

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.360
I'm gonna explain that right now.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.440
But first, let me introduce you all.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.470
This is Veldora-kun!

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:13.830
He's a tad shy around new people, 
but try to make friends with him!

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:23.300
Huh?

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:26.640
Wait! I'm not shy around new people at all!

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:30.180
It's just that not many people 
ever actually reached me alive!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.220
Treyni-san!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:38.780
Our guardian, Lord Veldora,

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:41.650
I congratulate you on your return
from the bottom of my heart.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.670
Oh, the Dryads, right? I remember them.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.540
Thanks for taking care of my Forest of Jura!

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.160
I am unworthy of such praise.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.360
Such a task is in no way enough 
to repay you for taking in

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:57.210
my sisters and me when we were 
separated from the Queen of Spirits.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:58.720
Don't worry about that!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.030
Our Lord!

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.050
Wait, is that the real Storm Dragon?!

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.430
You gotta be kidding.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.600
Keep looking out for Rimuru for me.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.960
You'll be looking out for me now, as well.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:17.430
Hey! What do you mean by that?

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.190
U-Um...

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:20.360
Yes?

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:24.780
Lord Veldora, just what is your 
relationship with Great Rimuru?

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:26.850
You wanna know?

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:28.900
Y-Yes, please!

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:31.280
Very well.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:38.140
Rimuru is my bosom buddy! My other half!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.830
My sword friend!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.850
My sword friend!

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.360
My sword friend!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.340
<i>Please stop! You're embarrassing me!</i>

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:51.590
What?! You're friends with not just 
Lady Milim, but Lord Veldora, as well?!

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:56.470
I knew Great Rimuru was 
amazing from the very start!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.270
At this point, anything goes.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.500
One should expect no less of my master!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.020
Precisely.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:07.110
Incidentally, why have you taken this form?

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.970
Rimuru had this body prepared for me!

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:12.720
Well?! I look awesome, right?!

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.660
Yes, you look wonderful.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.200
Don't I? Don't I?!

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:21.810
I understand now!

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:26.770
You appeared before us just 
after Lord Veldora vanished!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.170
I was keeping it secret.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:32.190
I thought it would take over 
100 years to free Veldora,

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:36.350
and if this had gotten out, 
there's no telling who would've come after me.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:37.680
True.

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:40.680
Great Rimuru!

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:44.690
The preparations for the feast are complete.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.780
Okay.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.360
Everyone, we've been through 
some pretty tough times,

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:04.580
but for today, you can eat, drink, 
and forget about all of it!

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:07.090
Let's just be glad we're all still alive!

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:26.150
<i>That evening progressed into a party 
wild enough to be likened to a festival.</i>

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:30.120
<i>Everyone was overjoyed to be 
revived and together again.</i>

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.880
I took a vicious attack! 
But then came my Exo-evade!

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.830
And then a rolling attack from 
behind with a forward punch!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.440
It'll be ready soon.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.140
Why me, too?

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.200
You have to experience 
Shion's cooking with me!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.110
Don't drag me into this!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.820
It might actually be good, by some miracle.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:14.570
Miracles don't happen that easily!

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.320
Thank you for waiting!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.010
Enjoy!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:29.050
Feel free to eat as much as you'd like!

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:32.750
Shion, do you know the 
meaning of the word "cook"?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.760
Of course I do, Great Rimuru!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.590
Well? Doesn't it look delicious?

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:40.960
Why does the onion still have its skin and 
roots?! And the tomatoes still have stems!

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:44.430
You're supposed to cut and peel 
and pick off stuff like that!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:48.580
Well, you see... when I try 
to do things like that,

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.940
I end up cutting the building along with it.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.870
Huh? Not just the table, but the building?

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:54.440
Yes.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:59.880
My Hercules' Edge is fantastically 
sharp, but it's a bit long...

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.500
You use that for cooking?!

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.320
Yes!

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:08.360
Since I was a child, I've always 
thought nothing was impossible,

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:09.870
but it seems I was overconfident.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:12.180
<i>How can he say that with 
such a handsome face?!</i>

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.570
S-Swords are not cooking tools!

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:18.930
Get it?! There are cooking knives, 
or even a small knife like this!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.600
I will use no blade but Hercules' Edge.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.680
I hate infidelity.

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:24.650
Oh, really?

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.890
And I was thinking of giving you 
a cooking knife as a gift...

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.840
I was wrong! I made a mistake!

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:32.140
Even Hercules' Edge says a 
little infidelity is fine!

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:35.780
Really? Then try to cook with 
a cooking knife from now on.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:36.520
I will!

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:43.990
<i>But with this kind of "cooking"... 
if you could even call it that...</i>

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:48.180
<i>It's no wonder you learn Poison 
Resistance if you eat enough of it.</i>

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.690
<i>I'm a Demon Lord now!</i>

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.540
<i>Just eating something isn't 
gonna kill me, right?!</i>

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.770
It's good!

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:18.530
How does it look so awful, 
but taste so amazing?!

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.580
Wh-What's the meaning of this?!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:24.220
Actually, the gift I got 
when I came back to life

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.310
gave me a new skill!

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:26.950
Huh?!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:30.150
The unique skill "Master Chef"!

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.400
Master...

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.460
...Chef?

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.730
With this skill,

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:39.970
anything I cook tastes just like I 
want it to, no matter how I cook it.

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:41.640
I-I see...

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:44.100
Thank goodness! Right, Benimaru?

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:44.850
Yes.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:48.900
Now we won't have to die.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.980
Well, let's eat!

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:51.750
Yes!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.620
It looks awful, but it really 
tastes good. So good.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:01.820
Yes, yes! Though it does look awful!

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.530
There's enough for seconds, too.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.650
That won't be necessary!

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:06.440
Huh?

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.960
<i>We learned something important tonight.</i>

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.540
<i>When it comes to cooking, 
appearances matter, too.</i>

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.980
Everyone, I'm sure you 
already know who this is,

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:26.900
but let me introduce him anyway.

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:30.100
This is Diablo-kun, the one who 
saved me from certain death.

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:33.500
He's new here, but he's really 
strong and dependable,

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:36.040
so I plan to put him to 
work as a second secretary.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.960
I'd like you all to treat him well.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:43.900
Everyone, I would deeply appreciate 
your guidance and encouragement.

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.460
Teach him the ropes of the job for me.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.700
Understood.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.540
And Gabiru...

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:52.350
Sir!

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:55.070
As of today, you're in charge of development.

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:58.080
It's a temporary position, 
but you'll be at the top of the ranks.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:58.420
Huh?!

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.180
I'll be counting on you.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:00.660
Wha... Bu...

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.410
I accept!

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:05.930
I, Gabiru, will devote my all to this task!

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:09.740
Yay! Sir Gabiru's moving up!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:12.180
Good. And now I'd like to discuss 
our plan for the future.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:15.010
Youm and the Three Beastketeers, 
this involves you guys,

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:16.060
H-Hey, you three! Quiet down!

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:16.060
so stay and listen.

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.060
I'll hear out whatever 
you have to say, Master.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:21.570
Does this have to do with 
the rescue of Lord Carrion?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.320
I decided to become a Demon Lord.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:27.410
Yes.

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.440
I said a Demon Lord.

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:31.220
Yes.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.200
A Demon Lord...

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.130
You already are one.

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.610
That's not what I mean.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:50.280
I'm going to announce to the whole 
world that I'm a Demon Lord.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:51.310
Oh?

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:55.140
You mean you intend to pick a 
fight with the other Demon Lords?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:56.480
Yes! Exactly!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.980
And by "other Demon Lords," I mean Clayman!

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:02.460
Oh?

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.780
I see.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.800
You want to steal the 
Demon Lord's throne yourself.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:11.800
Interesting!

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:12.990
That's right.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:16.780
The one behind everything that just 
happened was the Demon Lord Clayman.

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:19.620
I have no intention of letting 
him get away with it.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:25.260
<i>And then I told everyone my idea.</i>

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.150
Cleaning up in the Kingdom of Falmuth,

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:31.260
the need to keep the 
Western Holy Church in check,

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:35.040
and the rescue of the Demon Lord Carrion,

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:37.270
as we promised the Animal Kingdom.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.660
Rigurd.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.280
Sir!

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:41.600
You'll handle negotiations 
with the nations to the west.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:44.050
As you wish! You can count 
on me, Great Rimuru!

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:44.780
Benimaru.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:45.510
Sir!

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.450
Pull together the results 
of everyone's evolutions.

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:50.060
If we want to make use of all 
our forces against Clayman,

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:52.120
we need to know what our strengths are.

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:54.120
Understood, Great Rimuru.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:55.180
Shion.

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:55.670
Yes?

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.160
You'll interrogate the war prisoners.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.120
I will handle it, Great Rimuru.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.540
And don't take it too far. Understand?

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.540
No need to worry.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.370
I hope not...

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:07.880
Youm, Mjurran.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:08.760
Yeah?

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.620
Help Shion out.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:13.670
Get them to tell you whatever you 
can about the state of Falmuth,

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.040
and then we'll take the kingdom.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.470
You can count on me, Master.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:19.430
It's gonna be my kingdom, after all.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.190
Beastketeers, I'd like to 
ask you to help us, too.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:27.730
You need not even ask, 
Leader of the Forest of Jura.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:31.650
Ask us anything. We act on your orders.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:33.930
Good.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.950
Rebuild your strength and be 
ready for the coming battle!

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:37.640
Right.

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:38.370
Yeah!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:39.330
Rimuru, sir!

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:44.790
I hurried here in accordance with the 
security pact between Blumund and Tempest!

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.070
Fuze?

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.160
There were so many dead in the city!

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:50.660
How could those Falmuth bastards be so cruel?

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:53.800
Oh, th-they're not dead, they're aslee—

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:57.570
It isn't many, but I brought 
fifty fully-armed soldiers!

00:15:57.570 --> 00:16:00.730
All of them... are prepared.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.130
Falmuth's main army doesn't 
appear to have arrived yet,

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.630
but the king of Blumund has also 
sworn to mobilize the knights!

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:09.020
Hey, Fuze-kun, wait just a second.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.870
Oh, forgive me. Do you already have a plan?

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.110
Uh, yeah...

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.870
A plan... "Plan" might 
not be the right word...

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.570
Were you keeping it secret from us?

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.240
No, that's not it.

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:25.880
Listen, Fuze-kun. I really 
do appreciate your concern,

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.990
but it's already over.

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:28.670
Huh?

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.040
It's over? What do you mean?

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.920
What is over?

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.850
Uh... How do I put this?

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:40.720
Basically... in so many words, 
I wiped it out.

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:41.850
Wiped what out?

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.600
The Kingdom of Falmuth's army!

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:47.200
I completely annihilated it!

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:07.660
I get how you feel. Just go jump in 
the hot spring and rest for a while.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:08.380
Okay?

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:15.230
Show the soldiers to the 
inn and tell them to relax.

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:17.650
They came all this way, so be hospitable.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:18.340
Of course.

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:19.420
C'mon, let's go.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.720
N-No, no, no, no, no! Wait!

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.980
Oh... Looks like more visitors.

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.480
Visitors?

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:26.980
Not just any visitors.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:29.740
<i>Notice.</i>

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.710
<i>Thirty knights approaching.</i>

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:34.820
<i>They are led by the king of 
the Armed Nation of Dwargon,</i>

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:38.220
<i>the individual called Gazel Dwargo.</i>

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.620
<i>Hey, Raphael-san...</i>

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.320
<i>Yes?</i>

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:48.330
<i>It's gonna be a hassle to have you giving 
me details on everyone who comes here,</i>

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.880
<i>so keep it short, okay?</i>

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.140
<i>Short?</i>

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:55.350
<i>You can save it for when someone hostile 
toward me is coming, can't you?</i>

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:57.100
<i>Understood.</i>

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:02.890
Long time, Rimuru.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:05.570
I heard you've become a Demon Lord.

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.040
Yeah, some things happened... you know.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.640
It's gonna be a pain, frankly,

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:12.500
but we were just having a meeting 
to discuss future plans.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:16.740
Perfect timing. I will take 
part in this meeting, as well.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:23.030
Wha—

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.480
<i>When did they get here?!</i>

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:31.000
<i>Universal Detect didn't sense anything!</i>

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:36.010
<b>Notice</b>

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:31.810
<i>Notice.</i>

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:36.010
<i>I detect no obvious hostility in this group.</i>

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:39.680
<i>Oh, right... I said it 
was a hassle earlier...</i>

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.610
<i>Hmph.</i>

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:43.810
<i>I'm sorry, okay? Please give 
me clear reports from now on!</i>

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.310
<i>Okay, Raphael-san?</i>

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.980
Who are you people?

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:52.260
Well, well, if it isn't the 
king who likes to live...

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.360
hidden beneath the ground.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.100
I'm surprised.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:00.860
I never expected a coward like 
you to back a Demon Lord.

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:02.660
Ah, it's you.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:06.350
The descendant of the Elves who likes 
to live in ridiculously high places.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.870
You came down from your city 
surrounded by divine trees?

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.380
No... With that body, you're more likely...

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:18.130
Yes, it was made using an 
artificial human, a homunculus.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:22.140
I can't be careful enough when meeting one 
who claims to be a Demon Lord, after all.

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:26.880
<i>Wow, a homunculus so elaborate that I 
couldn't tell it apart from a human...</i>

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.140
<i>I wonder if he'll teach me how to make one.</i>

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:33.490
These people come from the 
Sorcerous Dynasty of Thalion.

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:35.480
You haven't changed, Erald.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:37.370
Neither have you, Gazel.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:39.900
And who might this be?

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:41.910
Nice to meet you.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:44.300
I'm the leader of this forest, Rimuru.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:44.950
I hope—

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:50.960
You!

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:55.990
You are the Demon Lord 
who seduced my daughter?!

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:57.680
Er... H-Huh?

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.260
I hope you've made your peace!

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.290
O flames, burn, dance, and rampage!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.930
Gather, flicker, and pour 
in a rain of violence!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.330
Wait, what the hell is he doing?!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.840
Scatter my enemy to the winds!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.130
<i>Notice.</i>

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:12.000
Burn him to ash until not a 
single shred of flesh remains!

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:11.250
<i>This is an extremely 
high-level explosion spell.</i>

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.690
Why's he using that all of a sudden?!

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:15.860
O flames, burn, dance, and rampage!

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.520
Gather, flicker, and pour 
in a rain of violence!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:21.060
You idiot!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.360
Scatter my enemy to the—

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:25.880
Ouch...

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.400
Dad! What the heck are you doing here?!

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:32.490
Eren! You're all right!

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:36.140
Of course I am! I came here of my own will!

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:38.340
Ah...

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.630
I'm so sorry.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.070
I received a report saying my daughter 
had been taken by a Demon Lord,

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:45.130
so I couldn't help panicking.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:47.140
<i>Couldn't help it, my ass!</i>

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:50.130
I see you're still an 
overprotective father, Erald.

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.930
I am not overprotective!

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:55.940
Eren is just so adorable, 
there's nothing else I can do.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.930
That's what most fathers would say.

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.860
No, nothing I say will do any good.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:05.430
Rimuru! This is my father and archduke 
of the Sorcerous Dynasty of Thalion!

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:07.450
His name's Erald Grimwald!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:12.800
Leader of the Great Forest of 
Jura and ruler of the monsters,

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.830
as my daughter Eren has just told you,

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:19.110
my name is Erald Grimwald.

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:21.360
Please, call me Erald.

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:22.590
S-Sure...

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:25.470
<i>I'd heard she was the daughter of nobility,</i>

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:28.570
<i>but I had no idea he was that big a deal.</i>

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:32.130
And is Eren-san the only reason you're here?

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.060
Of course not.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.060
<i>I figured.</i>

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:41.800
I wanted to see you with my own two eyes,

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:45.280
since my daughter is so taken with you.

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:50.030
Now, I will also be taking 
part in this meeting.

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:55.480
<i>Why do all these guys just 
do whatever they want?!</i>

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:02.420
<i>Thus the very important meeting to determine</i>

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:05.330
<i>what Tempest would do 
next was ready to begin.</i>

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:40.980
<u>A Meeting of</u> Humans and Monsters

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:39.470
<i>Next time, 
"A Meeting of Humans and Monsters."</i>
